  "description": "Given a string, find the number of different non-empty palindromic subsequences.",
  "target": null,
  "pseudocode": "1. n = s.length\n2. dp = new Array(n).fill(0).map(() => new Array(n).fill(0))\n3. for i from n-1 to 0:\n4.   dp[i][i] = 1\n5.   for j from i+1 to n-1:\n6.     if s[i] == s[j]:\n7.       dp[i][j] = dp[i+1][j-1] * 2 + (inner_logic)\n8.     else:\n9.       dp[i][j] = dp[i+1][j] + dp[i][j-1] - dp[i+1][j-1]",
